# The API image build context: global.json, everything under backend except tests and build output, and the
# embedded game-rule catalogs. A path under an excluded parent cannot be re-included, so docs is reopened level by
# level instead of naming docs/game-rules/catalogs directly. No HEALTHCHECK: the image has no curl, and Container
# Apps probes /health itself.
*
!global.json
!backend/
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/game-rules/
!docs/game-rules/catalogs/
!docs/game-rules/catalogs/*
**/bin/
**/obj/
# Explicit bin/obj depths without `**`: the `**` patterns above did not filter on the
# GitHub runner (PR #71: 18MB context vs 1.36MB green), while `**`-free patterns did.
# `bin*` also matches the literal-backslash `bin\Release` directories the host ef
# tooling leaves on Linux, which break MSBuild glob expansion (MSB3552). No tracked
# file under backend/src starts with bin or obj, so these match build output only.
backend/src/*/bin*/
backend/src/*/obj*/
backend/src/*/*/bin*/
backend/src/*/*/obj*/
backend/tests/
backend/src/CocAssistant.Api/App_Data/
